          'h' => 'On the job',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'On a doubled-rope system, Kalimba holds a Distel or VT hitch well with a matching hitch cord, and it tends a micro pulley cleanly. On a stationary rope system it pairs with devices such as the <a href="/climbing/climbing-gear/ascent-and-descent/mechanical-friction-devices/devices-for-srs/isc-rope-wrench/">ISC Rope Wrench</a> or a mechanical SRS device, as long as the device maker lists 11.9 mm in its approved range.',
