      'price' => 109,
      'keyword' => 'arborwear tech double thick pullover',
      'title' => 'Arborwear Tech Double Thick Pullover, Safety Yellow',
      'h1' => 'Arborwear Tech Double Thick Pullover Sweatshirt, Safety Yellow',
      'meta' => 'The Arborwear Tech Double Thick pullover in safety yellow: a warm, technical-fabric sweatshirt that is easy to spot on the job. Fit, care and typical price.',
      'tagline' => 'A bright, technical double-layer pullover for cold days on tree crews.',
      'summary' => 'The Arborwear Tech Double Thick pullover takes the brand\'s double-layer sweatshirt idea and builds it in a technical fabric that handles sweat better. The safety yellow color makes you easier to see on the ground and in the canopy.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Double layer technical fabric',
        1 => 'Safety yellow color for visibility',
        2 => 'Handles sweat better than cotton fleece',
        3 => 'Pullover style',
      ),
      'specs' => 
      array (
