      'title' => 'Husqvarna T525 Top Handle Chainsaw: Specs & Guide',
      'h1' => 'Husqvarna T525 Top Handle Chainsaw',
      'meta' => 'Husqvarna T525 top handle chainsaw: a light 27 cc arborist chainsaw for pruning aloft. Specs, bar sizes, real use in the tree and safety notes.',
      'tagline' => 'A very light 27 cc top-handle saw for pruning and fine work aloft.',
