        1 => 'The line has spread to shirts, flannels, jackets, hats and lighter pants for warm weather, but pants are still what most people come for. Arborwear pants are not chainsaw protective by themselves, so pair them with chaps on the ground or choose dedicated chainsaw pants when the job calls for them.',
